_clan_generation":"20260920121535","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-142.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-142[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Stop the @epic tribe panel flickering when new nodes join it[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A new agent node joining the @epic tribe panel produces exactly one[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]visual transition: the panel widget is never blanked, its highlight[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and scroll position survive, the agent-list column geometry settles[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]in the same frame as the rows, and an apply that changes nothing [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]repaints nothing. The claim is proved by a deterministic [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]frame-level harness in CI and re-proved by a landed-SHA soak on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]athena that actually creates new nodes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]epic_panel_new_node_flicker.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/epic_panel_new_node_flicker.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-142[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-142/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Deterministic frame-level repro for a node joining @epic[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]flicker-frame-harness[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]flicker-frame-harness: build the per-refresh paint log and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]no-blank/one-transition invariants, drive a new node into an @epic clan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel through the real apply pipeline under the host's grouping, query [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and collapse shape, and land it green with a strict xfail on every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]invariant the current tree violates.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop collapsed panels forcing a full rebuild on every apply[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]collapsed-panel-mode[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]collapsed-panel-mode: record the active grouping mode when a panel [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paints collapsed so the stale_grouping_mode guard stops sending 232 of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]234 applies down the full-rebuild path, without weakening the guard for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]panels that hold rows from an earlier mode.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add rows in place and settle the column in one frame[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]row-insert-without-blanking[dim] · [dim][/dim]after flicker-frame-harness, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]collapsed-panel-mode[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]row-insert-without-blanking: give AgentList an in-place row insert to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mirror try_remove_rows so an added node stops clearing and re-emitting [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the whole panel, and make the agent-list container width settle inside [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the refresh that changed the rows instead of one pump cycle later.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove it on athena with real node arrivals and close [/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]sase-13i.4[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify-new-nodes-on-athena[dim] · [dim][/dim]after flicker-frame-harness, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]collapsed-panel-mode, row-insert-without-blanking[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify-new-nodes-on-athena: soak a landed SHA under the host's real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state while deliberately creating nodes that join the @epic tribe, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]assert the harness invariants from traces and live captures, then close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-13i.4 with the evidence or record precisely why it still cannot [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-142","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-142.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8cef82eabb25be99e1476b9330971c49","started_at":"2026-09-20T16:16:29.815225+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"83b242b42ff5fd478b24f3faf7ed5b5ed76df5111cf2eb834e5e0399576f8777","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-142.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-142.4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"66e3bbe49e05a2bb84295f4481f95caaf21ea9a4b53fa21d3ee853326e4f8e07","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-142.4/meta.json","size_bytes":639},"prompt":{"digest":"aadfe63f3b6b1f3b65640957d9418e106e2dad4389f5793d995604639cd5c4f2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-142.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":208},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"7b37e162b5b7597914b6ed5a43340ec8fda28268ff5ac38f13f608df4ad48b28","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-142.4/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4204},"state":{"digest":"af5043491f63f4d2cee7a356b4fc655e89c7bc82c3e1f2d8bb974c8d08d92de5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-142.4/state.json","si